WEBVTT

00:13:28.729 --> 00:13:32.109
net voor jy hierdie sessie kom doen het.

00:13:32.109 --> 00:13:33.805
Boyd Varty: Wel, dankie, Pat.

00:13:33.805 --> 00:13:37.148
Ek is so gelukkig, want dit was tyd
vir hom om aan te beweeg.

00:13:37.148 --> 00:13:38.759
Hy het gely.

00:13:38.759 --> 00:13:41.157
So daar's natuurlik gemengde gevoelens.

00:13:41.157 --> 00:13:43.141
Maar ek dink net aan so baie voorvalle

00:13:43.141 --> 00:13:45.548
soos toe hy op "Oprah" was

00:13:45.548 --> 00:13:48.404
en haar gevra het waaroor
die program sou wees.

00:13:48.404 --> 00:13:49.882
(Gelag)

00:13:49.882 --> 00:13:53.180
En sy was soos: "Wel, oor jou."

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:56.428
Ek bedoel, dis net
ongelooflike nederigheid.

00:13:56.428 --> 00:14:00.141
(Gelag)